    "segment_id": "101_000",
    "title": "Storage limitation",
    "text": "Under GDPR, personal data may be kept no longer than needed for its purpose. For a rejected candidate, the purpose ends when the vacancy is filled, unless the candidate agrees to stay in a talent pool.",
